From: N0zoM1z0 <161784452+N0zoM1z0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:43:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Define the string literals of main()'s TU in C++

The literal pool follows source order. ZUN's "m" extension was "m\0\0",
since stage_fn_set_ext() copies three bytes. MAIN's BGM titles are spaced
differently from the Music Room's, so they get their own Shift-JIS header.
---
